1gzg|n|The sliding weight on a steelyard. ; See Peak, n., 3. ; A plant, and its fruit, of the genus Pisum, of many varieties, much cultivated for food. It has a papilionaceous flower, and the pericarp is a legume, popularly called a pod. ; A name given, especially in the Southern States, to the seed of several leguminous plants (species of Dolichos, Cicer, Abrus, etc.) esp. those having a scar (hilum) of a different color from the rest of the seed.	a:200i,75,1;1udo,39,2;1vhw,38,3~1vhw,38,3;1udo,39,2;200i,75,1	v:unn,148,2~unn,148,2	V:qz3,70,6~qz3,70,6	n:mob,85,4;200i,75,1~mob,85,4;200i,75,1	N:1t6k,104,5;sdd,103,3;1jbw,92,8;8y4,57,1;1v0x,17,1~1jbw,92,8;1t6k,104,5;sdd,103,3;1v0x,17,1;8y4,57,1
